an media mavjud emas.</div><?php endif;?></div></section><section class="statement"><div><div class="label">02 — Human side</div><h2>Ta’limni<br><span>insonlar</span> yaratadi.</h2></div><p class="lead">Kuchli maktab — bu faqat dastur yoki bino emas. Uning xarakterini har kuni o‘quvchi bilan ishlaydigan insonlar yaratadi. Bu sahifa jamoaning haqiqiy tajribasi, roli va hikoyalarini tartibli ravishda namoyish qilish uchun qurilgan.</p></section><section class="team" id="team"><div class="team-head"><div><div class="label">03 — Team</div><h2>Odamlar.<br><span>Maqsad.</span></h2></div><p>Har bir profil JSON orqali boshqariladi. Faqat tasdiqlangan ism, lavozim, tajriba va bio ko‘rsatiladi.</p></div><div class="members"><?php if($team):foreach($team as $i=>$x):$img=(string)($x['image']??'');?><article class="member"><div class="portrait"><?php if($img!==''):?><img src="../<?=e(ltrim($img,'/'))?>" alt="<?=e($x['name']??'Chimyon School jamoasi')?>" loading="lazy"><?php else:?><div class="pending">PORTRAIT PENDING</div><?php endif;?></div><div class="member-meta"><div class="member-no"><?=str_pad((string)($i+1),2,'0',STR_PAD_LEFT)?></div><h3><?=e($x['name']??'')?></h3><div class="role"><?=e($x['role']??'')?></div><?php if(!empty($x['bio'])):?><p class="bio"><?=e($x['bio'])?></p><?php endif;?></div></article><?php endforeach;else:?><div class="empty">TEAM CONTENT PENDING — `data/jamoa.json` ichida tasdiqlangan jamoa ma’lumotlari hozircha mavjud emas.</div><?php endif;?></div></section><section class="closing"><h2>Yaxshi ta’lim<br><span>yaxshi jamoadan boshlanadi.</span></h2><a href="qabul.php">Chimyon School →</a></section></main><footer class="footer"><strong><?=e($name)?></strong><span>Team / People</span><a href="../index.php">← Bosh sahifa</a></footer></body></html>